{title: Dil Dhoondta Hai (Slow)}
{artist: Bhupinder Singh Madan Mohan}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D],        dil dhundata data hai,
[A],        phir wahi fursat ke raat din
[A] [D] [G],        baithe rahe tasawwoor-ye-jana kiye huye
[D] [G] [A]
jaadon ki narma dhup aur aangan me let kar
[D] [G] [A]
aankho pe khinch kar tere aanchal ke saaye ko
[A] [D] [G],        aundhe pade rahe kabhee karawat liye huye
[D] [G] [A]
yaa gamreeyon kee raat jo purawaiyan chale
[D] [G] [A],        thhandee safed chaadaro pe jaage der tak
[A] [D] [G]
taaron ko dekhate rahe chhat par pade huye
[D] [G] [A],        barfeeli sardiyon me kisi bhi pahaad par
[D] [G] [A],        waadi me gunjati huyi khamoshiyan sune
[A] [D] [G]
aankho me bheeege bhige se lamhe liye huye
